  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "We welcome you to Camellia Blue, a luxury setting just two lots from the white sugar-sand beach in Old Seagrove. Offering a county owned public beach with no restrictions on access or recreation LESS THAN 150 steps from the front door. Sleeps 22 with private heated pool, rooftop patio, 2 outdoor kitchens, game area and 3 living spaces. Steps to beach, shops & dining. Two master suites, two custom-built bunk rooms, spacious kitchen, and multiple entertainment areas make this perfect for families or groups. Visiting with your girlfriends? Two complete mahjong sets are available for your enjoyment, remember to bring your cards. Watch sunsets from the 4th floor patio or bike to Seaside. Style, comfort & location—all in one unforgettable stay! <br><br>As you enter this grand home, the first floor welcomes you to a spacious entertaining space, three bedrooms and a playful backyard pool oasis. The second level begins with a completely open luxury kitchen, dining and living concept with a back porch overlooking the pool. With steps leading to the pool from the second level porch, the yard and living connection is perfect for families to enjoy their own private outdoor space. Complete with a screened-in summer kitchen that offers great family experiences. The 1st master suite is on the 2nd level, as well as a private study. The 3rd floor has additional living space and three bedrooms, one of which is the main master bedroom & phenomenal ensuite bath featuring a combined walk-in bath/shower with 5 showerheads and a gulf view. For triple convenience and maximum comfort, the first 3 levels of the home each offer a full-size washer and dryer set. And a dedicated office space means you can keep up with work commitments while still enjoying the beauty of your surroundings. Nothing better to cap your workday off with a scenic hike or a stunning sunset. <br><br>This home features an elevator which goes to all levels including the 4th floor patio. Experience the breathtaking views and unforgettable sunsets of Seagrove Beach with unobstructed coastal views! A true luxury setting! 32 Camellia Street offers every convenience in a location that's only minutes away from the shops and restaurants. Enjoy the six seater golf cart and seven adult bikes as you explore the most charming beach towns along the Gulf Coast. Only a 45 second walk to the beach and you are where you need to be. And with a recently updated driveway, the home can now accommodate up to 5 vehicles.<br><br>Nestled in-between Seaside & Watercolor, there are a plethora of places to go & things to see…stunning views, amazing food, upscale boutiques, live music, movies under the stars & even a farmer’s market every Saturday. <br><br>Parties, events, vaping, smoking, & pets are strictly prohibited. Guests found in violation are subject to eviction with no refund.<br><br>ACCOMODATIONS/FLOOR:<br>1st FLOOR<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ King Bed, Full Bath, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ King Bed, Full Bath, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Custom-Built Bunkroom w/ 2 Full Over Full Beds, Full Bath, Shelving, & 4 USB Charging Stations<br>*Additional Full Bath w/ Walk-In Shower<br>*Full-Size Washer & Dryer Set<br><br>2nd FLOOR<br>*1st Master Suite w/ King Bed, Stunning Master Bath, Walk-In Shower, & Soaking Tub, Small Sitting Area, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Full-Size Washer & Dryer Set<br>*Private Study<br><br>3rd FLOOR<br>*Main Master Suite w/ King Bed, Stunning Master Bath, Combined Walk-In Bath & Shower w/ 5 Showerheads & View of the Gulf, Small Sitting Area, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ 2 Queen Beds, Full Bath, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Custom-Built Bunkroom w/ 3 Full Over Full Beds, Full Bath, Cubbies, & 6 USB Charging Stations<br>*Additional Full Bath w/ Walk-In Shower<br>*Full-Size Washer & Dryer Set<br><br>AMENITIES:<br>*Private Heated Pool - Pool Heating is an Additional $45/Day<br>*6-Seater Golf Cart<br>*7 Adult Bikes<br>*Elevator<br>*2 Complete Mahjong Sets w/ Tables (Cards Not Included)<br>*Sonos System<br>*4th Floor Ocean View Patio w/ Bar<br>*2 Outdoor Kitchens<br>*Screened-In Outdoor Dining on 2nd Floor<br>*Outdoor Dining on 1st, 2nd, & 4th Floor<br>*3 Living Areas<br>*Private Study<br>*Full Size Washer & Dryer Sets on 1st, 2nd, & 3rd Floor<br>*Wet Bars on 1st & 3rd Floor<br>*Parking for Up to 5 Vehicles (Driveway Only)<br>*Outdoor Shower<br>*Gas Grill<br>*High Speed Fiber Wi-Fi<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS: <br>*45 Second Walk to Beach Access<br>*County Owned Beach – Public Beaches w/ NO Restrictions on Access or Recreation<br>*0.9 Miles to Publix<br>*No Smoking, No Vaping, No Pets<br>*Minimum Age Requirement to Rent is 25<br>*Must be 1 Adult to Accompany Each 4 Guests Under the Age of 25<br>*No Parties/Events Allowed<br><br>DINING/DRINKS/TREATS/SHOPPING NEARBY:<br>*Bud & Alley’s<br>*Food Truck Row in Central Square<br>*Seaside Farmer’s Market - Every Saturday in Central Square<br>*Cafe Thirty-A<br>*Surfing Deer<br>*Old Florida Fishhouse<br>*Beachy Bean Coffee Co.<br>*The Perfect Pig<br>*FOOW",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
